<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - B. Stearns ups Quantum.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - B. Stearns ups Quantum.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Andy Neff upgraded disk drive maker Quantum Corp to attractive from neutral, his office said.</p>
<p>-- Neff set earnings estimates of $1.45 per share for the fiscal 1997 year and $2.90 per share for fiscal 1998, his office said.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
